---
/**
 * Coaching page: “PROGRAM” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-23d2a85 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="23d2a85"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  id="organisational"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-e53cbbf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="e53cbbf"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-e67f779 vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="e67f779"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content"><h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> PROGRAM </span></h3></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-f60e30d vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="f60e30d"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Organisational Leadership Development</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-351568a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
        data-id="351568a"
        data-element_type="container"
        data-e-type="container"
        data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
      >
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-c509e69 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
          data-id="c509e69"
          data-element_type="widget"
          data-e-type="widget"
          data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
        >
          <div class="vb-widget-container">
            <p>
              <span style="font-weight: 400;"
                >Strong leadership teams create stronger organisations. Misalignment between leaders often slows
                execution, creates confusion, and weakens accountability.</span>
            </p><p>
              <span style="font-weight: 400;"
                >Team coaching helps leadership groups improve collaboration, communication, trust, and execution.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-9f315df e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="9f315df"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
      data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-0ebc8f0 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="0ebc8f0"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container"><h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Areas covered include</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-6f0d6e2 vb-icon-list--layout-inline coaching-benefit vb-align-start vb-list-item-link-full_width vb-widget vb-widget-icon-list"
        data-id="6f0d6e2"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-list.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <ul class="vb-icon-list-items vb-inline-items">
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Leadership alignment workshops </span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item"><span class="vb-icon-list-text">Team communication </span></li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Cross-functional collaboration </span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item"><span class="vb-icon-list-text">Conflict resolution</span></li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item"><span class="vb-icon-list-text">Role clarity</span></li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Decision-making alignment</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Leadership accountability</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Team performance improvement </span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Organisational communication</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Role Clarity, Succession Planning &amp; Delegation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Collaboration, People Management &amp; Accountability</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Conflict Resolution &amp; Navigating Difficult Conversations</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item vb-inline-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Building Psychological Safety &amp; Inclusive Culture</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
